Title: Advanced Encryption Tool - User Guide

Introduction

Overview of the tool and its purpose.
Installation

Prerequisites:
Python 3.8+
Required libraries:
Copy code
pip install -r requirements.txt
Packaging the application:
bash
Copy code
pyinstaller --onefile gui/app_gui.py
How to Use

Encrypt a File:
Launch the application.
Enter a strong password.
Click "Encrypt File" and select the file to encrypt.
Save the encrypted file.
Decrypt a File:
Enter the same password used for encryption.
Click "Decrypt File" and select the encrypted file.
Save the decrypted file.
Troubleshooting

Invalid Password: Ensure the password matches the one used for encryption.
Corrupted File: If the file was modified, decryption may fail.